imize for security at the cost of latency. Our evaluation strives to make these points clear. }{\*\bkmkend _Toc964099612}\lang1033\langfe1033\fs22\cf1\par\pard\plain\s2\ql\keepn1\keep1\outlinelevel1\sb200{\lang1033\langfe1033\b\fs26\cf3 \page }{\*\bkmkstart _Toc309904276}{\lang1033\langfe1033\b\f2\fs26\cf3 4.1\~\~Hardware and Software Configuration}{\*\bkmkend _Toc309904276}\lang1033\langfe1033\b\f2\fs26\cf3\par\pard\plain\ql\lang1033\langfe1033\fs22\cf1\par\pard\plain\qj\fi720{\shp{\*\shpinst\shpleft0\shptop465\shpright5774\shpbottom4785\shpwr2\shpbxcolumn\shpbxignore\shpbypara\shpbyignore\shpz5\shpwrk0{\sp{\sn fLine}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFilled}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fillColor}{\sv 16777215}}{\sp{\sn posrelh}{\sv 2}}{\sp{\sn posrelv}{\sv 2}}{\sp{\sn fAllowOverlap}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fBehindDocument}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn dxWrapDistLeft}{\sv 114300}}{\sp{\sn dxWrapDistRight}{\sv 114300}}{\sp{\sn dyWrapDistTop}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn dyWrapDistBottom}{\sv 365760}}{\sp{\sn sizerelh}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn pctHoriz}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn sizerelv}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn pctVert}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn wzName}{\sv Picture 11}}{\sp{\sn pib}{\sv{\pict\pngblip\picw10185\pich7619\picwgoal5774\pichgoal4319\picscalex100\picscaley100 
